[TITLE]
EPANET rule-based controls regression test

[JUNCTIONS]
J1  0  1

[RESERVOIRS]
R1  30

[TANKS]
T1  0  10  5  15  100  0

[PIPES]
;ID            Node1  Node2  Length  Diameter  Roughness  MinorLoss  Status
Base           R1     J1     1000    200       120        0          Open
TimePipe       R1     J1     900     150       120        0          Open
ClockPipe      R1     J1     950     150       120        0          Open
PressurePipe   R1     J1     1050    150       120        0          Open
FlowPipe       R1     J1     1100    150       120        0          Open
LogicPipe      R1     J1     1150    150       120        0          Open
ConflictPipe   R1     J1     1200    150       120        0          Closed
EqualPipe      R1     J1     1250    150       120        0          Open
TimeEqualPipe  R1     J1     1300    150       120        0          Open
ClockEqualPipe R1     J1     1350    150       120        0          Open
TankRulePipe   R1     J1     1400    150       120        0          Open
FillTimePipe   R1     J1     1450    150       120        0          Open
DrainTimePipe  R1     J1     1500    150       120        0          Open
TankConnection J1     T1     1000    200       120        0          Open

[PUMPS]
PSet  R1  J1  POWER 1

[RULES]
RULE ELAPSED
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 0:20
THEN PIPE TimePipe STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE TimePipe STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 2

RULE CLOCK_WINDOW
IF SYSTEM CLOCKTIME >= 1:00 AM
AND SYSTEM CLOCKTIME < 2:00 AM
THEN PIPE ClockPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE ClockPipe STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 2

RULE PRESSURE_AND_DEMAND
IF JUNCTION J1 PRESSURE ABOVE 300
AND SYSTEM DEMAND > 0.5
THEN PIPE PressurePipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 3

RULE FLOW_VALUE
IF LINK Base FLOW ABOVE 0
THEN PIPE FlowPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 3

RULE OR_PRECEDENCE
IF LINK TimePipe STATUS IS CLOSED
OR LINK ClockPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
AND SYSTEM TIME >= 1:00
THEN PIPE LogicPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE LogicPipe STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 3

RULE LOW_PRIORITY
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 0:10
THEN PIPE ConflictPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 1

RULE HIGH_PRIORITY
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 0:10
THEN PIPE ConflictPipe STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 5

RULE EQUAL_FIRST
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 0:10
THEN PIPE EqualPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 4

RULE EQUAL_SECOND
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 0:10
THEN PIPE EqualPipe STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 4

RULE PUMP_SETTING
IF SYSTEM TIME >= 0:20
AND PUMP PSet SETTING > 0.9
THEN PUMP PSet SETTING IS 0.5
PRIORITY 6

RULE TIME_EQUALITY
IF SYSTEM TIME = 0:25
THEN PIPE TimeEqualPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 7

RULE CLOCK_EQUALITY
IF SYSTEM CLOCKTIME = 1:05 AM
THEN PIPE ClockEqualPipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 7

RULE TANK_LEVEL
IF TANK T1 LEVEL ABOVE 9
THEN PIPE TankRulePipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 7

RULE TANK_FILLTIME
IF TANK T1 FILLTIME BELOW 200
THEN PIPE FillTimePipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 7

RULE TANK_DRAINTIME
IF TANK T1 DRAINTIME ABOVE 100
THEN PIPE DrainTimePipe STATUS IS CLOSED
PRIORITY 7

[TIMES]
Duration             3:00
Hydraulic Timestep   1:00
Pattern Timestep     1:00
Report Timestep      0:30
Rule Timestep        0:10
Start ClockTime      12:30 AM

[OPTIONS]
Units       LPS
Pressure    KPA
Headloss    H-W
Trials      100
Accuracy    0.001

[END]
